<div class="management-auth-shell"><section class="management-auth-story"><span class="management-eyebrow">SerendibBank operations</span><h1>One more<br><em>step.</em></h1><p>Confirm your sign in to enter the management workspace.</p><div class="management-story-line"></div><small>Authorized personnel access</small></section><section class="management-auth-card" aria-labelledby="management-verify-title"><span class="management-eyebrow">Account verification</span><h2 id="management-verify-title">Check your inbox.</h2><p>Enter the six-digit code sent to <?= $escape($data['email']) ?>. It expires in five minutes.</p><?php if (!empty($data['error'])): ?><div class="management-alert" role="alert"><?= $escape($data['error']) ?></div><?php endif; ?><form method="post" action="/verify" class="management-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= $escape($data['csrfToken']) ?>"><label for="management-code">Verification code</label><input id="management-code" name="code" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9]{6}" minlength="6" maxlength="6" required><button class="management-button" type="submit">Open workspace <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></form><p class="management-auth-note"><a href="/login">Request a new code</a></p></section></div>
